# Escape hatch for locally trained models you do NOT want in git.
# Both of the models used in Part 5 ARE committed (model/variant_clf.joblib and
# model/variant_clf_gb.joblib) so a clean clone can replay either deployment
# path. Anything you name *_local.joblib stays on your laptop instead.
model/*_local.joblib
